  "document_type": "bible_chapter",
  "number": 80,
  "title": "Psalms 80",
  "display_title": "Psalms 80",
  "translation": "King James Version",
  "translationCode": "KJV",
  "bookId": "psalms",
  "book": "Psalms",
  "bookName": "Psalms",
  "bookOrder": 19,
  "testament": "old",
  "chapter": 80,
  "sortOrder": 19080,
  "verseCount": 19,
  "aliases": [
    "Psalm",
    "Psalms",
    "Ps",
    "Psa",
    "Psm"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Give ear, O Shepherd of Israel, thou that leadest Joseph like a flock; thou that dwellest between the cherubims, shine forth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Before Ephraim and Benjamin and Manasseh stir up thy strength, and come and save us.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "Turn us again, O God, and cause thy face to shine; and we shall be saved.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "O LORD God of hosts, how long wilt thou be angry against the prayer of thy people?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "Thou feedest them with the bread of tears; and givest them tears to drink in great measure.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "Thou makest us a strife unto our neighbours: and our enemies laugh among themselves.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Turn us again, O God of hosts, and cause thy face to shine; and we shall be saved.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Thou hast brought a vine out of Egypt: thou hast cast out the heathen, and planted it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "Thou preparedst room before it, and didst cause it to take deep root, and it filled the land.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "The hills were covered with the shadow of it, and the boughs thereof were like the goodly cedars.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "She sent out her boughs unto the sea, and her branches unto the river.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "Why hast thou then broken down her hedges, so that all they which pass by the way do pluck her?",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "The boar out of the wood doth waste it, and the wild beast of the field doth devour it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "Return, we beseech thee, O God of hosts: look down from heaven, and behold, and visit this vine;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "And the vineyard which thy right hand hath planted, and the branch that thou madest strong for thyself.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "It is burned with fire, it is cut down: they perish at the rebuke of thy countenance.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "Let thy hand be upon the man of thy right hand, upon the son of man whom thou madest strong for thyself.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "So will not we go back from thee: quicken us, and we will call upon thy name.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:80:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "Turn us again, O LORD God of hosts, cause thy face to shine; and we shall be saved.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 80:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:80:19"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
